+C---- INSTRUMENTATION: Open log file for subroutine tracing (legacy). The closure log of
+C     every call grows without bound on a long run, so it is written only when
+C     log_closures.txt exists (the cases whose closure fixtures are cut from it); otherwise
+C     unit 98 goes to /dev/null.
+      INQUIRE(FILE='log_closures.txt', EXIST=LCLOG)
+      IF(LCLOG) THEN
+       OPEN(98, FILE='xfoil_subroutine_log.dat', STATUS='REPLACE')
+      ELSE
